# Save states (28 Oct 2026): CPC 6128 Plus (system cartridge), f1 BASIC, then
# SAVE"A", SAVE"B" and CAT on the disk in drive A (a blank one), so states are
# taken while the disk controller writes and with unsaved disk changes.
200 F1 5
350 S 3
356 A 3
362 V 3
368 E 3
374 SHIFT+2 3
380 A 3
386 SHIFT+2 3
392 RETURN 3
700 S 3
706 A 3
712 V 3
718 E 3
724 SHIFT+2 3
730 B 3
736 SHIFT+2 3
742 RETURN 3
1000 C 3
1006 A 3
1012 T 3
1018 RETURN 3
1300 QUIT
